WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
If this is your prep this video will walk you through exactly how to take it.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.160
Just follow along step by step.

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:11.860
Your prep contains three packets, one Mango flavored packet, and two Fruit Punch

4
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:12.480
packets.

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.360
You'll also need the mixing container that comes with it and water.

6
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.520
Start with your first dose.

7
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.560
This is the Mango packet, and you'll take it the evening before your procedure.

8
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.760
Open the Mango packet and pour it into the container.

9
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:31.570
Add 16 ounces of water up to the fill line, shake or stir it until it's

10
00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:32.400
completely dissolved.

11
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:38.160
Now take your time, slowly drink all of it within 30 minutes.

12
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.480
There's no rush, just keep sipping steadily.

13
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:45.600
Once you've finished refill the same container or a 16 ounce cup with water.

14
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.800
Drink this glass of water within 30 minutes too.

15
00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:56.800
Your second dose happens 12 hours after the first.

16
00:00:56.800 --> 00:00:59.520
This time, you'll use both Fruit Punch packets.

17
00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:03.920
Open both Fruit Punch packets and pour them into the container.

18
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:08.720
Add water to the 16 ounce fill line and shake or stir until dissolved.

19
00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:13.840
Just like before, slowly drink all of it within 30 minutes.

20
00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:19.560
Then refill the container with 16 ounces of water and finish that within 30

21
00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.000
minutes.

22
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.520
The timing of this second dose is really important.

23
00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:27.440
Make sure you take it at the right time so your prep is as effective as

24
00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:28.240
possible.

25
00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:33.070
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed even if you're already

26
00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:34.080
passing clear

27
00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:38.390
liquid. I know it can feel like enough but finishing the entire dose is what

28
00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:39.120
gives us the

29
00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:44.000
clearest view during your procedure. If the prep isn't completed as directed,

30
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.720
we may need to reschedule and neither of us wants that.

31
00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:51.020
After you've finished each dose keep drinking clear liquids throughout the

32
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:51.520
evening.

33
00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:56.080
Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the prep do its job.

34
00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.240
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom,

35
00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:03.920
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

36
00:02:03.920 --> 00:02:10.020
That's it. You've got this. Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay

37
00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:10.560
hydrated.

38
00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:15.500
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office. We're here

39
00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:16.080
to help.
